<div class="quality-integrity-note" id="quality-record-integrity">
  <h3>Integrity in quality decisions</h3>
  <p>The quality-culture procedure also addresses truthful inspection and test records, protection of confidential information, and reporting concerns. It prohibits falsifying results, concealing nonconforming products and bypassing the approved release process. Training and review support these responsibilities.</p>
